{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "04", "m": "11", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "11", "M": "41", "S": "18"}}, "news": [{"title": "Dhauli Heights allottees object to \u2018conditional\u2019 handover of keys", "para": "Members of the Dhauli Heights Association of Allottees are expressing frustration over the unexpected delays in receiving flat possession and keys. They argue that the Odisha Cooperative Housing Corporation is enforcing unreasonable conditions to get access to their homes. The association highlights that varying agreements are being drawn up due to ongoing legal issues among different allottees.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/dhauli-heights-allottees-object-to-conditional-handover-of-keys/135530154?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-148506/135530154.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Chandigarh housing board opens six-month window for old GPA property transfers", "para": "Chandigarh Housing Board has made a significant move by approving a six-month extension of the property transfer policy specifically for General Power of Attorney transactions. This initiative aims to help property buyers from before 2011 who haven\u2019t managed to complete their registrations. Those eligible can now establish formal ownership with necessary paperwork, along with a proposed one-time interest waiver of Rs 20 crore benefiting around 14,000 individuals.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/chandigarh-housing-board-opens-six-month-window-for-old-gpa-property-transfers/135529830?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-90154/135529830.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "NLMC puts HIL's 5.119-acre Delhi land parcel on e-auction block at \u20b9830 crore", "para": "